  {topic:'Pharmacy / drug handling',authority:'Fla. Stat. ch. 465 and ch. 499, as applicable',why:'If the business manufactures, distributes, repackages, or dispenses drugs, determine the precise activity and which pharmacy or drug/device/cosmetic licensing provisions apply.',url:'https://www.leg.state.fl.us/statutes/'}
